            "rationale": "The change adds no new lending rule. The unknown-branch outcome comes from the existing `shelf` projection. Hold queue order and positions come from Tier 2 `Holds.queueFor`. The new Tier 3 code only selects, sorts and formats rows. Sorting by book id and numbering positions are presentation of what Tier 2 returned, not a decision about legality.",
