            "rationale": "Branch existence and the rules for adding a copy (DEC-011: unknown book, duplicate copy) are decided by Tier 2 `Catalog.findBranch` and `Catalog.addCopy`. Tier 3 only parses lines, numbers errors and folds the results all-or-nothing through `commit`. The count of waiting holds comes from Tier 2 `Holds.queueFor`. Tier 3 only picks the status wording, as projection.",
